# Tiptap Rich Text Editor Plugin

Professional content editing with full formatting, Markdown/HTML support, and extensibility.

## Files Added

- `src/components/ui/editor/rich-text-editor.tsx` — Main editor component
- `src/components/ui/editor/index.ts` — Barrel export
- `docs/tiptap.md` — Complete guide and examples

## Quick Start

```tsx
import { RichTextEditor } from "@/components/ui/editor";

export function MyEditor() {
  return (
    <RichTextEditor
      placeholder="Write something..."
      onChange={(html) => console.log(html)}
    />
  );
}
```

## Features

✓ Bold, italic, code, lists, headings  
✓ Links and images  
✓ Markdown ↔ HTML conversion  
✓ Read-only display mode  
✓ Undo/Redo  
✓ Full TypeScript support  
✓ Accessibility-first  

## Components

- **RichTextEditor** — Full editing interface with toolbar
- **RichTextDisplay** — Read-only content display
- **htmlToMarkdown()** — Convert HTML to Markdown
- **markdownToHtml()** — Convert Markdown to HTML

## Dependencies

- `@tiptap/react` — React integration
- `@tiptap/starter-kit` — Core extensions
- `@tiptap/extension-placeholder` — Placeholder
- `@tiptap/extension-link` — Links
- `@tiptap/extension-image` — Images

See `docs/tiptap.md` for complete documentation.
